<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>This is a reminder of&nbsp;a previous&nbsp;email from the USPTO Reference-Check Team&nbsp;</strong></p>

<p>Dear&nbsp;{{{Appointment_Request__c.Reference_First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
I am reaching out in my role as the reference check team lead with the United States Patent and Trademark Office.&nbsp;{{{Appointment_Request__c.Selectee_Name__c}}} has applied for the Patent Examiner position and listed you as a reference.<br />
<br />
My team would like to&nbsp;hear from you&nbsp;about&nbsp;your experience with&nbsp;{{{Appointment_Request__c.Selectee_Name__c}}}.&nbsp;We can schedule a brief 10-minute call, or you may complete a questionnaire to discuss your experience working with, teaching, or mentoring&nbsp;{{{Appointment_Request__c.Selectee_Name__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Whichever&nbsp;option&nbsp;you choose, please note that reference checks are&nbsp;required&nbsp;before a selectee can move forward in the hiring process, and your prompt response is appreciated.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Please&nbsp;{{{Appointment_Request__c.URL_Invite__c}}}&nbsp;to either fill out the questionnaire form or to reserve a slot to speak with a USPTO employee&nbsp;regarding&nbsp;your&nbsp;reference.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Your insights will help us make an informed hiring decision, and we truly appreciate your time and input.<br />
<br />
If you have any questions, please reach out to <a href="mailto:USPTOReferenceChecks@uspto.gov">USPTOReferenceChecks@uspto.gov</a><br />
<br />
<br />
Thank you,<br />
<br />
U.S. Patent and Trademark Office, Office of Human Resources</p>
